{"text":"<p><span>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gwLaf5-qefU</span></p><p><br /></p><p>### 20-1. Saññojanaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-41-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-41a-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20212.269186043774\">5:36:52</span> 1. Nosaññojanaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nosaññojano kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41a-1</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20224.394296963954\">5:37:04</span> 2. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41a-2</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20228.69369698455\">5:37:08</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20235.147081200845\">5:37:15</span> 3. Saññojanaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojano akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Saññojanaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nosaññojano akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Saññojanaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojano akusalo ca nosaññojano akusalo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-41a-3</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20266.63808526779\">5:37:46</span> 4. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41a-4</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20272.099892208567\">5:37:52</span> Nahetuyā tīṇi, naadhipatiyā nava…pe… nakamme tīṇi…pe… navippayutte nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20278.508295105574\">5:37:58</span> (Sahajātavāropi…pe… sampayuttavāropi paṭiccavārasadisā vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-41b-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20286.80678311587\">5:38:06</span> 5. Saññojano akusalo dhammo saññojanassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41b-5</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20297.349467835207\">5:38:17</span> 6. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava…pe… upanissaye āsevane nava, kamme tīṇi, āhāre indriye jhāne tīṇi, magge sampayutte nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41b-6</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20303.181074190543\">5:38:23</span> 7. Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41b-7</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20307.081029850655\">5:38:27</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20311.058506005153\">5:38:31</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20315.031986958802\">5:38:35</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### Abyākatapadaṃ ^7-41c-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20327.257026860956\">5:38:47</span> 8. Nosaññojanaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nosaññojano abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41c-8</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20340.286567956227\">5:39:00</span> 9. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41c-9</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20345.399880886704\">5:39:05</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 21-1. Saññojaniyaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-41d-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-41e-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20350.5138840927\">5:39:10</span> 10. Saññojaniyaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojaniyo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-41e-10</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20358.519159149346\">5:39:18</span> Asaññojaniyaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca asaññojaniyo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20366.656963149344\">5:39:26</span> 11. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41e-11</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20370.08251603347\">5:39:30</span> (Yathā cūḷantaraduke lokiyadukagamanaṃ, evaṃ imampi ñātabbaṃ. Sahajātavāropi…pe… pañhāvāropi vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20383.484720169945\">5:39:43</span> 12. Saññojaniyaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojaniyo akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41e-12</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20395.453695007724\">5:39:55</span> 13. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41e-13</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20401.206053028323\">5:40:01</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### Abyākatapadaṃ ^7-41f-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20406.269352935626\">5:40:06</span> 14. Saññojaniyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojaniyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-41f-14</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20415.478223971677\">5:40:15</span> Asaññojaniyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca asaññojaniyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Asaññojaniyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojaniyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Asaññojaniyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojaniyo abyākato ca asaññojaniyo abyākato ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20447.560245737357\">5:40:47</span> Saññojaniyaṃ abyākatañca asaññojaniyaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojaniyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20459.736634938203\">5:40:59</span> 15. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe dve, adhipatiyā pañca…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41f-15</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20470.599352804304\">5:41:10</span> Cūḷantaraduke lokiyadukasadisaṃ. (Sahajātavāropi…pe… sampayuttavāropi vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-41g-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20481.755462113295\">5:41:21</span> 16. Saññojaniyo abyākato dhammo saññojaniyassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-41g-16</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20492.38618812102\">5:41:32</span> Asaññojaniyo abyākato dhammo asaññojaniyassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20502.768712118446\">5:41:42</span> 17. Hetuyā cattāri, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā cattāri…pe… avigate satta (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41g-17</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyuddhāro</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20509.210562012875\">5:41:49</span> 18. Saññojaniyo abyākato dhammo saññojaniyassa abyākatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo… purejātapaccayena paccayo… pacchājātapaccayena paccayo… āhārapaccayena paccayo… indriyapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41g-18</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20533.974275961376\">5:42:13</span> 19. Nahetuyā satta, naārammaṇe satta (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41g-19</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20538.22527698198\">5:42:18</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe cattāri (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20541.578733915027\">5:42:21</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20545.411046226593\">5:42:25</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 22-1. Saññojanasampayuttaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-41h-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-41i-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20557.96034903605\">5:42:37</span> 20. Saññojanavippayuttaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojanavippayutto kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41i-20</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20571.114844884127\">5:42:51</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20575.153873956224\">5:42:55</span> (Sahajātavārepi …pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20580.826090945928\">5:43:00</span> 21. Saññojanasampayuttaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojanasampayutto akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-41i-21</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20590.8119850618\">5:43:10</span> Saññojanasampayuttaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojanasampayutto akusalo dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20601.449329012874\">5:43:21</span> 22. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe pañca, adhipatiyā ekaṃ…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ, anulomaṃ). ^7-41i-22</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Nahetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20607.37060393305\">5:43:27</span> 23. Saññojanasampayuttaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojanasampayutto akusalo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā – vicikicchāsahagate khandhe paṭicca vicikicchāsahagato moho. Saññojanasampayuttaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojanavippayutto akusalo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā – uddhaccasahagate khandhe paṭicca uddhaccasahagato moho. (2) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-41i-23</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20623.82033808497\">5:43:43</span> 24. Nahetuyā dve, naadhipatiyā pañca, napurejāte pañca…pe… nakamme tīṇi…pe… navippayutte pañca (saṃkhittaṃ, paccanīyaṃ). ^7-41i-24</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-41j-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20635.155139000002\">5:43:55</span> 25. Saññojanasampayutto akusalo dhammo saññojanasampayuttassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-41j-25</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20644.98707275796\">5:44:04</span> Saññojanavippayutto akusalo dhammo saññojanasampayuttassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20658.06955377083\">5:44:18</span> Saññojanasampayutto akusalo dhammo saññojanasampayuttassa akusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… nava.</p><p><br /></p><p>Saññojanasampayutto akusalo dhammo saññojanasampayuttassa akusalassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20668.403037175092\">5:44:28</span> 26. Adhipatiyā ekaṃ, anantare samanantare nava, sahajāte pañca, upanissaye āsevane nava, kamme tīṇi, magge tīṇi, sampayutte pañca, atthiyā pañca. (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-41j-26</p><p><br /></p><p>#### Abyākatapadaṃ ^7-41k-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20682.865034154496\">5:44:42</span> 27. Saññojanavippayuttaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojanavippayutto abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41k-27</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20696.445493920175\">5:44:56</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20701.47589703862\">5:45:01</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 23-1. Saññojanasaññojaniyaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-41l-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-41m-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20706.510239226594\">5:45:06</span> 28. Saññojaniyañceva no ca saññojanaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojaniyo ceva no ca saññojano kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41m-28</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20718.965249285815\">5:45:18</span> 29. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41m-29</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20723.856038840357\">5:45:23</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20729.1737109485\">5:45:29</span> 30. Saññojanañceva saññojaniyañca akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojano ceva saññojaniyo ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41m-30</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20742.104320920178\">5:45:42</span> 31. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41m-31</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20747.84045974766\">5:45:47</span> Nahetuyā tīṇi, naadhipatiyā nava, napurejāte nava, napacchājāte nava, naāsevane nava, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke nava, navippayutte nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20761.888178976827\">5:46:01</span> (Sahajātavāropi…pe… sampayuttavāropi paṭiccavārasadisā.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20768.17331577598\">5:46:08</span> 32. Saññojano ceva saññojaniyo ca akusalo dhammo saññojanassa ceva saññojaniyassa ca akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41m-32</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20779.486545\">5:46:19</span> 33. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava…pe… upanissaye āsevane nava, kamme āhāre indriye jhāne tīṇi, magge sampayutte nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41m-33</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20785.160825915027\">5:46:25</span> 34. Nahetuyā nava naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41m-34</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20789.109508837777\">5:46:29</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20792.76379204892\">5:46:32</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20796.45127586868\">5:46:36</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20809.23848094593\">5:46:49</span> 35. Saññojaniyañceva no ca saññojanaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojaniyo ceva no ca saññojano abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41m-35</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20825.096102061798\">5:47:05</span> 36. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41m-36</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20829.9509969897\">5:47:09</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 24-1. Saññojanasaññojanasampayuttaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-41n-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-41o-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20834.918525226592\">5:47:14</span> 37. Saññojanañceva saññojanasampayuttañca akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojano ceva saññojanasampayutto ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-41o-37</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20848.8653250927\">5:47:28</span> Saññojanasampayuttañceva no ca saññojanaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojanasampayutto ceva no ca saññojano akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>Saññojanañceva saññojanasampayuttaṃ akusalañca saññojanasampayuttañceva no ca saññojanaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojano ceva saññojanasampayutto ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20863.520557084972\">5:47:43</span> 38. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41o-38</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20869.465100064375\">5:47:49</span> Nahetuyā tīṇi, naadhipatiyā nava, napurejāte nava, napacchājāte nava, naāsevane nava, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke nava, navippayutte nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20884.63958190988\">5:48:04</span> (Sahajātavāropi… sampayuttavāropi paṭiccavārasadisā vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20894.688641205994\">5:48:14</span> 39. Saññojano ceva saññojanasampayutto ca akusalo dhammo saññojanassa ceva saññojanasampayuttassa ca akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41o-39</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20908.35258403862\">5:48:28</span> 40. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava…pe… upanissaye āsevane nava, kamme āhāre indriye jhāne tīṇi, magge sampayutte nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41o-40</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20918.88847908755\">5:48:38</span> 41. Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava, naadhipatiyā nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41o-41</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20922.820174195695\">5:48:42</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20925.75722423689\">5:48:45</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20929.269480012874\">5:48:49</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 25-1. Saññojanavippayuttasaññojaniyaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-41p-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-41q-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20942.362541144194\">5:49:02</span> 42. Saññojanavippayuttaṃ saññojaniyaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojanavippayutto saññojaniyo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-41q-42</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20958.66267311587\">5:49:18</span> Saññojanavippayuttaṃ asaññojaniyaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojanavippayutto asaññojaniyo kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20972.331478046348\">5:49:32</span> 43. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41q-43</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20977.317540925327\">5:49:37</span> (Yathā cūḷantaraduke lokiyadukasadisaṃ. Sahajātavāropi…pe… pañhāvāropi sabbattha vitthāretabbā.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20990.214380079822\">5:49:50</span> 44. Saññojanavippayutto saññojaniyo akusalo dhammo saññojanavippayuttassa saññojaniyassa akusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41q-44</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21004.091408236894\">5:50:04</span> 45. Ārammaṇe ekaṃ (sabbattha ekaṃ, saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41q-45</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21007.89917103862\">5:50:07</span> 46. Saññojanavippayuttaṃ saññojaniyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojanavippayutto saññojaniyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-41q-46</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21022.4061559794\">5:50:22</span> Saññojanavippayuttaṃ asaññojaniyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojanavippayutto asaññojaniyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Saññojanavippayuttaṃ asaññojaniyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojanavippayutto saññojaniyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Saññojanavippayuttaṃ asaññojaniyaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojanavippayutto saññojaniyo abyākato ca saññojanavippayutto asaññojaniyo abyākato ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21074.258896061798\">5:51:14</span> Saññojanavippayuttaṃ saññojaniyaṃ abyākatañca saññojanavippayuttaṃ asaññojaniyaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojanavippayutto saññojaniyo abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21094.047032061797\">5:51:34</span> 47. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe dve, adhipatiyā pañca…pe… āsevane ekaṃ, kamme pañca, vipāke pañca…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41q-47</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21104.01661487898\">5:51:44</span> Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naārammaṇe tīṇi, naadhipatiyā dve, napurejāte cattāri, napacchājāte pañca, naāsevane pañca, nakamme ekaṃ, navipāke ekaṃ, navippayutte dve…pe… novigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21127.193563231744\">5:52:07</span> (Sahajātavāropi…pe… sampayuttavāropi paṭiccavārasadisā.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21132.152381958804\">5:52:12</span> 48. Saññojanavippayutto saññojaniyo abyākato dhammo saññojanavippayuttassa saññojaniyassa abyākatassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41q-48</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21147.092259169945\">5:52:27</span> 49. Hetuyā cattāri, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā cattāri, anantare cattāri…pe… avigate satta (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41q-49</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21156.39117784808\">5:52:36</span> 50. Nahetuyā satta, naārammaṇe satta (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-41q-50</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21160.6799910412\">5:52:40</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe cattāri (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21165.275211254917\">5:52:45</span> Nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21173.88108307982\">5:52:53</span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>Saññojanagocchakakusalattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p></p>","media-time":21193.252447}